sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Plan lessons
    %% Stories: 25, 26, 27, 28, 29, 30, 31, 32, 47, 49, 60
    %% Description: An admin adds and removes trainers. A trainer checks free rooms, adds a lesson with its details to the schedule, and views the own schedule and training sessions.
    actor AD as Admin
    actor TP as Trainer (person)
    participant TR as Trainer
    participant RM as Room
    participant SC as Schedule
    participant LE as Lesson
    participant TS as TrainingSession

    %% covers 47, 49
    AD->>TR: add or remove trainer
    %% covers 25
    TP->>RM: see free rooms at a timeslot
    %% covers 26
    TP->>TR: add lesson to the schedule
    TR->>SC: trainer's schedule
    SC->>LE: new lesson
    %% covers 27, 28, 30, 31
    TP->>LE: set lesson details
    %% covers 29
    TP->>LE: set room
    LE->>RM: room of the lesson
    %% covers 32, 60
    TP->>TR: view schedule and training sessions
    TR->>SC: trainer's schedule
    SC->>TS: training sessions
